OL,3,GNEWSASupermodel Coco Rocha has 'full
OL,4,Acircle moment' at Ireland Fashion Week
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 80 designers are taking part
OL,7,Fin the second edition of the event,
OL,8,Fwhich is billed as a showcase for Irish
OL,9,Ffashion, culture and creativity. Shows,
OL,10,Ftalks and exhibitions are planned
OL,11,Facross the country.
OL,13,FRocha said modelling at the event felt
OL,14,Flike a "full circle moment", as she was
OL,15,Ffirst discovered at an Irish dancing
OL,16,Fcompetition as a teenager.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
